{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:05 2026-05-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:05 2026-05-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:05 2026-05-25 HKT</p><p>大角咀發生工業意外。今日（25日）早上11時48分，海輝道38號新油麻地公眾貨物裝卸區一名74歲姓陳男工人，由2米高的工作平台墮下，頭部受傷倒地。救援人員趕到，發現男工昏迷不醒，隨即將他送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救。警方列作「工業意外—有人意外受傷」，正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"現場是海輝道38號新油麻地公眾貨物裝卸區。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ee63a231f0b7c564ee922f8ff7ddf1e8/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_140958415.jpg\"/><img alt=\"新油麻地公眾貨物裝卸區一名男工人，由2米高處墮下昏迷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/039747066def670856bf6914e7491bb2/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_140958415_01.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/79f45ccc9d2ed9f38750def49655b5e3/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_140958415_02.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場是海輝道38號新油麻地公眾貨物裝卸區。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/96e83cd132d4334306d61852713846f2/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_140958415_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d2186097c5234dd591cce2df82557b79/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_140958415_04.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/79fba31e2cb5f21de26a14c1516deb01/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_140958415_05.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-25T08:39:22.431700+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}